# Cloudflare Pages — custom response headers.
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/headers/
#
# Always revalidate the stylesheet (and the pages that reference it) so a CSS
# update never leaves a returning visitor on a stale cached copy. The ETag
# makes revalidation cheap: a 304 "Not Modified" when nothing changed.
# Belt-and-suspenders with the ?v= query string on the <link> in the HTML.

/styles.css
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

/
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

/faq
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
